package A
  @@ Top-level system @@
  part X
    @@ Subsystem X1 @@
    part X1
      @@ Sub-subsystem X2 @@
      part X2
        @@ State flag @@
        let x in boolean
      part
    part
  part

  requirement R0 on X is
  @@ very broad requirement @@
  requirement

  requirement R1 on X::X1 refines R0 is
  @@
  Some tests 1
  @@
  requirement

  requirement R2 on X::X1::X2 refines R1 refines R0 is
  @@
  Some tests 2
  @@
  requirement

  requirement R3 on X::X1::X2::x refines R1 refines R2 is
  @@
  Some tests on {X::X1::X2::x}
  @@
  requirement

package
